 <h3> <a href="/OpenForum/Giraffe">Giraffe</a> </h3>

 <!--Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Giraffe/QuickReference" section="1" --><!--End Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Giraffe/QuickReference" section="1" --><br />
