 <h3> <a href="/OpenForum/Triggers">Triggers</a> </h3>

 <!--Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Triggers/QuickReference" section="1" --><!--End Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Triggers/QuickReference" section="1" --><br />
 <!--Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Triggers/QuickReference/QuickReference" section="1" --><!--End Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Triggers/QuickReference/QuickReference" section="1" --><br />
 <!--Extension Popup id="QR_Triggers" sourceFileName="page.html.fragment" sourcePageName="/OpenForum/Triggers/QuickReference" --><div id="QR_Triggers" class="reveal-modal" data-reveal aria-labelledby="QR_TriggersModalTitle" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog"><!--Content built using /OpenForum/Javascript/PageBuilder/default-page.builder.js 0.0.7 Gloomy November builder and renderer DefaultRenderer v1.08 2021 Covid release-->
<h3>QuickReference</h3>

<p>
Triggers cause scripts to be run when an event occurs on the server. There are four event trigger types in OpenForum<ul><li> <a href="/OpenForum/Triggers/StartTrigger">Server Start Triggers</a></li>
<li> <a href="/OpenForum/Triggers/PageChangeTrigger">Page Change Triggers</a></li>
<li> <a href="/OpenForum/Triggers/RebuildTrigger">Rebuild Triggers</a></li>
<li> <a href="/OpenForum/Triggers/TimerTrigger">Time Triggers</a></li>
</ul></p>
<p>
Each trigger has its own page. The page can contain a bullet list of pages where triggers can be found. The trigger script is expected to be found in a file called trigger.sjs
</p>
<p>
The one exception is the TimerTrigger page which also has a <a href="/OpenForum/Triggers/TimerTrigger/TaskScheduler">Task Scheduler App</a>. 
This provides a user interface to add scripts that can be run at specific periods or at set dates and times.
There is also an option to decide if a script should run based on a script.
</p>
  <a class="close-reveal-modal" aria-label="Close">&#215;</a></div><!--End Extension Popup id="QR_Triggers" sourceFileName="page.html.fragment" sourcePageName="/OpenForum/Triggers/QuickReference" --><br />
 <!--Extension Popup id="QR_Triggers" title="Quick Reference" --><a class='button small round' onClick="$('#QR_Triggers').foundation('reveal', 'open');;return false;">Quick Reference</a><!--End Extension Popup id="QR_Triggers" title="Quick Reference" --> <b><a href="/OpenForum/Triggers/QuickReference" target="newTab">Open in a new tab<img src='/OpenForum/Images/icons/png/link_go.png' /></a></b><br />


<hr/>

 <h3> <a href="/OpenForum/Users">Users</a> </h3>

 <!--Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Users" section="1" --><!--End Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Users" section="1" --><br />

</div><!--End Extension ChildrenContentsPage pageName="/OpenForum" -->
</xmp>
<!--End Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Extensions/ChildrenContentsPage" section="1" --><br />


